{"suttaId":"tha-ap442","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[790,815],"vripara":"81"},"segments":{"tha-ap442:0.3":"Ambaphaliyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap442:1.1":"“Padumuttarabuddhassa, lokajeṭṭhassa tādino;","tha-ap442:1.3":"Piṇḍāya vicarantassa, dhārato uttamaṃ yasaṃ.","tha-ap442:2.1":"“Aggaphalaṃ gahetvāna, vippasannena cetasā;","tha-ap442:2.3":"Dakkhiṇeyyassa vīrassa, adāsiṃ satthuno ahaṃ.","tha-ap442:3.1":"“Tena kammena dvipadinda [dipadinda (sī. syā. pī.)], lokajeṭṭha narāsabha;","tha-ap442:3.3":"Pattomhi acalaṃ ṭhānaṃ, hitvā jayaparājayaṃ.","tha-ap442:4.1":"“Satasahassito kappe, yaṃ dānamadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap442:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, aggadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap442:5.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap442:6.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap442:7.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap442:8.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ambaphaliyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti;","tha-ap442:9.1":"Ambaphaliyattherassāpadānaṃ dasamaṃ.","tha-ap442:10.1":"Ekavihārivaggo catucattālīsamo.","tha-ap442:11.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","tha-ap442:12.1":"Thero ekavihārī ca, saṅkhiyo pāṭihīrako;","tha-ap442:12.3":"Thaviko ucchukhaṇḍī ca, kaḷambaambāṭakado.","tha-ap442:13.1":"Harītakambapiṇḍī ca, ambado dasamo yati;","tha-ap442:13.3":"Chaḷasīti ca gāthāyo, gaṇitāyo vibhāvibhi."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
